span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Tegirmonlar (quvvati sutkasiga 150 tonnadan kam don yanchadigan), guruch maydalagichlar, don mahsulotlarini ishlab chiqarish korxonalari.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:21%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">25</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:15%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:4%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">125.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:59%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Oziq-ovqat sanoatida foydalaniladigan modda va qorishmalar uchun ekstraksiya ishlatadigan korxonalar.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:21%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">25</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:15%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:100%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">13. Chorvachilik tarmoqlari</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:4%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">126.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:59%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Soʻyish va mahsulotlarni qayta ishlashni oʻz ichiga olgan 100 ming boshdan ortiq tovuqchilik, oʻrdakchilik, 50 ming boshdan ortiq kurkachilik, gʻozchilik fabrikalari.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:21%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">25</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:15%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:4%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">127.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:59%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">100 boshdan 2000 boshgacha qoramolchilik va yilqichilik fermalari, 200 boshdan 2000 boshgacha qoʻychilik va echkichilik fermalari, 50 boshdan 1200 boshgacha choʻchqachilik fermalari.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:21%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">25</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:15%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:4%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">128.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:59%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Sutkasiga 50 boshdan ortiq qoramol, 200 boshdan ortiq qoʻy, echki hamda sutkasida 5 ming boshdan ortiq parrandalarni soʻyish va mahsulotni qayta ishlash korxonalari.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:21%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">25</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:15%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:100%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">III. Atrof muhitga taʼsir koʻrsatishning III toifasiga mansub (past darajada xavfli) faoliyat turlari va obyektlari</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:100%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Transport, elektrotexnika va yoʻl xoʻjaligi</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:4%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">129.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:59%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><s