="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">181.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:59%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ishlab chiqarish hajmi yiliga 300 tonnadan kam boʻlgan sintetik va kompozit materiallardan polimer mahsulotlar, shu jumladan, qurilish mahsulotlari (gulqogʻoz, linoleum va laminat qoplama va shu kabilar) ishlab chiqarish korxonalari.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:21%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:15%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7,5</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:4%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; background-color:white; border-top:none; 