New Roman",serif">4. Arizani rad etish uchun asoslar mavjud boʻlmaganda, loyihani ishlab chiquvchini reyestrga kiritadi va bu haqida loyihani ishlab chiquvchini (reyestr raqamini koʻrsatgan holda) xabardor qiladi.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none; width:1%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:21%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ariza kelib tushgan kundan boshlab besh ish kuni ichida</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:10%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:none; border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="width:1%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:17%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:none; border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="width:1%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:44%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px; height:19px; background-color:white; border-top:none; border-right:none; border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify; text-indent:11.2pt"></p></td><td style="width:1%; padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px